{"ID":"20240506082120-60sy2n7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082120-60sy2n7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082120-60sy2n7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627094328-jbp5h03\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612132016-ll5lvhn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627095658-foiva7k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"237乌贼鱼骨（海螵蛸、乌贼骨、墨鱼鱼骨）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821164235"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240716115809-9qkkvpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716115809-9qkkvpa","updated":"20240716115809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t乌贼科动物无针乌贼Sepiella maindroni de Rochebrune 或金乌贼Sepia esculenta Hoyle的干燥内壳。收集乌贼鱼的骨状内壳，洗净，干燥。\n【产地】\t主产于山东沿海地区。\n【性状】\t无针乌贼：呈扁长椭圆形，中间厚，边缘薄，长914cm，宽2.53.5cm，厚约1.3cm。背面有磁白色脊状隆起，两侧略显微红色，有不甚明显的细小疣点；腹面白色，自尾端到中部有细密波状横层纹；角质缘半透明，尾部较宽平，无骨针。体轻，质松，易折断，断面粉质，显疏松层纹。气微腥，味微咸。\n金乌贼：长13"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"23cm，宽约至6.5cm。背面疣点明显，略呈层状排列；腹面的细密波状横层纹占全体大部分，中间有纵向浅槽；尾部角质缘渐宽，向腹面翘起，末端有1骨针，多已断落。\n【性味】\t咸、涩，温。\n【功效】\t收敛止血，涩精止带，制酸，敛疮。用于胃痛吞酸，吐血衄血，崩漏便血，遗精滑精，赤白带下；溃疡病。外治损伤出血，疮多脓汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240716115809-stbr2ka","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716115809-stbr2ka","updated":"20240716115809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206110753-22hkmdz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716115809-yls6fcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716115809-yls6fcn","updated":"20240716115809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"海螵蛸"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/海螵蛸-20240205165235-y7ksqcy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627094328-jbp5h03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627094328-jbp5h03","updated":"20240627094332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 502px;","style":"width: 492px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌贼鱼骨"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌贼鱼骨-20240627094328-vsk39lt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 492px;\" parent-style=\"width: 502px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821162236-pm2c01x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821162236-pm2c01x","updated":"20240821162236"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 466px;","style":"width: 456px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌贼 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌贼 1-20240821162236-aax6yxt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 456px;\" parent-style=\"width: 466px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 657px;","style":"width: 647px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌贼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌贼-20240821162114-avet1gz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 647px;\" parent-style=\"width: 657px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627095658-foiva7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627095658-foiva7k","updated":"20240821163519"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 578px;","style":"width: 568px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240627095659-xrxclpd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 568px;\" parent-style=\"width: 578px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 579px;","style":"width: 569px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌贼 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌贼 5-20240821163510-jcis60h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 569px;\" parent-style=\"width: 579px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821161932-1lswg4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821161932-1lswg4d","updated":"20240821164027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 465px;","style":"width: 455px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"乌贼鱼骨4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/乌贼鱼骨4-20240627094710-ihs30ph.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 455px;\" parent-style=\"width: 465px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"wi